## 5. Layout

### Display
Support `display`: block, inline, inline-block, flex, inline-flex, grid, inline-grid, flow-root, none. Add other values only if the engine and output pipeline support them safely. When setting `display:none`, warn and provide a way to reselect the hidden element through Navigator.

### Flexbox
Expose Direction, Wrap, Justify Content, Align Items, Align Content, Gap/Row Gap/Column Gap, and child Flex Grow/Shrink/Basis/Order/Align Self.

### Grid
Expose template columns/rows/areas, auto columns/rows/flow, row/column gap, container alignment, item placement, and self-alignment.

### Other layout
- `box-sizing`: content-box, border-box.
- `aspect-ratio`.
- Multi-column properties (`columns`, `column-count`, `column-width`, `column-rule`) as advanced controls where practical.
- `contain` and `content-visibility` only in Advanced with clear behavior/performance warnings.

