## 31. Definition of Done

- Property Editor distinguishes Text Alignment, Content Alignment, and Item Alignment.
- Block, Flexbox, and Grid have correct context-aware controls.
- Common production CSS properties are supported through visual controls.
- Advanced valid CSS values can be entered and preserved.
- Responsive values and inheritance work consistently.
- Theme tokens and local overrides behave predictably.
- Property changes update canvas, save/reload, undo/redo, and published output.
- Editor and published CSS render consistently.
- Property Editor is usable on Desktop, Tablet, and Mobile.
- No Portfolio style data or metadata is stored in Supabase.
- Support matrix and known limitations are documented.

